<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-KPN to acquire remaining TNT shares.</title>
<headline>RTRS-KPN to acquire remaining TNT shares.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch post and telecoms group Koninklijke PTT Nederland NV (KPN) said on Friday it has started to compulsorily acquire the outstanding shares in transport firm TNT Ltd.</p>
<p>KPN said that following the close of offers on December 12 it was entitled to 98.1 percent of the issued ordinary shares of TNT and 99.7 percent of converting preference shares.</p>
<p>Compulsory acquisition notices to non-accepting shareholders were despatched on Thursday, it said. The acquisition was expected to be completed by the end of January, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
